        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze 36 Inch Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oil Rubbed Bronze Offset 36 Inch Door Handle can be used in residential or commercial settings. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, back to back mounting, or surface mounting. This 36 Inch Offset Rectangular Door Pull is made from oil rubbed bronze powder coated on stainless steel. It has a modern appeal perfectly suited to remodels and new builds alike. This Offset Door Pull is 37-1/16 inches long with 36 inch mounting centers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-offset-8-inch-door-handle\"><b>8 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-offset-12-inch-door-handle\"><b>12 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-offset-24-inch-door-handle\"><b>24 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Doorware Designs RTOPULL36-613:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 37-1/16\" (940mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\" (914mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1\" (25mm) x 1/2\" (13mm)</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 2-5/16\" (60mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable rectangular rosettes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTOPULL36-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262423\"><b>DWD-RTOPULL36 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oil Rubbed Bronze Offset 36 Inch Door Handle",
                "description": "The Oil Rubbed Bronze Offset 36 Inch Door Handle can be used in residential or commercial settings. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, back to back mounting, or surface mounting. This 36 Inch Offset Rectangular Door Pull is made from oil rubbed bronze powder coated on stainless steel. It has a modern appeal perfectly suited to remodels and new builds alike. This Offset Door Pull is 37-1/16 inches long with 36 inch mounting centers.",
